# Firebase Analytics / GA4 connector (free — no billing account required).
#
# 1. Enable the "Google Analytics Data API" in the Google Cloud project behind
#    your Firebase app.
# 2. Create a service account, download its JSON key.
# 3. In GA4 -> Admin -> Property Access Management, add the service-account
#    email as a Viewer on the property.
# 4. Paste the entire key file below on one line, then restart the dev server.
#
# GA4_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON={"type":"service_account","project_id":"...","private_key":"-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\n...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n","client_email":"...@....iam.gserviceaccount.com"}
#
# Alternatively point at the key file on disk:
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=/absolute/path/to/service-account.json
